{"id":"b81ca8392ded6879","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-poset-ideal.md","title":"ZFC Poset Ideal","display":"df-zfc-poset-ideal — ZFC Poset Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-poset-ideal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-poset-ideal"],"display":"df-zfc-poset-ideal — ZFC Poset Ideal","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-poset-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-poset-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-poset-ideal — ZFC Poset Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\leq_P,I\\in V,\\quad I\\subseteq P\">\\(P,\\leq_P,I\\in V,\\quad I\\subseteq P\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetIdeal}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPosetIdeal}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcPosetIdeal}_S(I,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\varnothing\\neq I\\subseteq P\\land\\forall x\\in I\\;\\forall y\\in P\\;(y\\leq_P x\\to y\\in I)\\land\\forall x,y\\in I\\;\\exists z\\in I\\;(x\\leq_P z\\land y\\leq_P z)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcPosetIdeal}_S(I,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\varnothing\\neq I\\subseteq P\\land\\forall x\\in I\\;\\forall y\\in P\\;(y\\leq_P x\\to y\\in I)\\land\\forall x,y\\in I\\;\\exists z\\in I\\;(x\\leq_P z\\land y\\leq_P z)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A poset ideal is nonempty, downward closed, and upward directed within itself.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,\\leq_P,I\\in V,\\quad I\\subseteq P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetIdeal}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcPosetIdeal}_S(I,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\varnothing\\neq I\\subseteq P\\land\\forall x\\in I\\;\\forall y\\in P\\;(y\\leq_P x\\to y\\in I)\\land\\forall x,y\\in I\\;\\exists z\\in I\\;(x\\leq_P z\\land y\\leq_P z)","display":true}],"bytes":863,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3117","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-poset-ideal.md|58-df-zfc-poset-ideal]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","9ee45afab4c00dd5"]}